  suppose ex M2,N2,N3 being EnvEpsTerm of V st [N2,N3] in SigmaRed(V) &
      eComp(A,B) = eComp(M2,N2) & W1 = eComp(M2,N3);
    then consider M2,N2,N3 being EnvEpsTerm of V such that
    D1: [N2,N3] in SigmaRed(V) & eComp(A,B) = eComp(M2,N2) & W1 =
